  "content": "I was brought to the Hospital by my mother because of an acute asthma attack. I suddenly felt light and I floated. I saw my mother from above rubbing my hands and pleading to the nurses to take care of me as my hands suddenly became cold and limp. At that moment, I blacked out and as sudden, as there was darkness a light shines through very bright but not blinding. I saw a closed gate suddenly opened and clouds rising around it. As I entered the gate I heard a voice telling me' Go back, Bernardette (not the name I use but Bernardita). It is not time yet. You have not met me yet.' At that instant I was revived with an injection.",
